        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Austria, Micronesia\n- Songs: Deutschlandlied, Patriots of Micronesia, Austrian national anthem\n\nFacts:\n- Austria reinstated the song \"Deutschlandlied\" as its national anthem after using another song.\n- The melody of the song that Austria had used in between was later used in \"Patriots of Micronesia.\"\n- \"Patriots of Micronesia\" uses the melody of Austria’s former interim anthem song.",
